# API documentation (required)

Read `AGENTS.md` for full instructions.

## Architecture
- **Separate client & server** — deploy independently, no `shared/` folder
- **Separate env:** `client/.env` and `server/.env.local` only
- **No `apps/` folder** — use root `client/` and `server/`
- **No root node_modules**

## Node.js
- Minimum **Node 22+**

## Types and utils
- Duplicate types/utils in each app (no shared imports)

## Every API endpoint
Update **both** in the same PR (no markdown API docs):
1. `docs/openapi.yaml` — path, schemas, auth, examples
2. `docs/postman/hr-saas.postman_collection.json` — runnable request; save `accessToken` in test script when returned

## README
Update `README.md` when setup, env, commands, architecture, or deployment changes. Link to `docs/openapi.yaml` and `docs/postman/` for API details — do not duplicate them.
